": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jRw2ys6Ykq4Q7kNvwHrsHNQ&_nc_oc=AdrXCewfg5DkiPofIlLLyFJz8REhfGZU8RdXRt-ZyPk3L9367dxuxEPsZFT9OCoGlzc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMMFJ2lQtd5d_kqDXEZugxpzqLdPa9tLKcdN1enVWcZEA&oe=6AC9111B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jLM276K-wOoQ7kNvwECacs8&_nc_oc=AdqJ1P48kv74-qFLADTJ95ccoEzLyay6j9t5AgLcdDJSCk27nrhHCJuP9pnxdyKxDJM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOIqHXTCc-3NpZdpofCkJZNAoqrDjIHK7WPyE4ZarmC5w&oe=6AC90161"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=viNAaQEkKlcQ7kNvwHSpZrn&_nc_oc=AdrFb4CGMX6nGtuaz89h_Kyyv11jGGVAkUOGL5Gia8spRCjVHduw-1aIsWmShty0atY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhmXGnO9RQ9trSPiSKDeEYT5mFWSIWmlanbqcgem1EZg&oe=6AC8EE2F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MM4wzElDyMEQ7kNvwEoIJO-&_nc_oc=AdpFi0WB9m1ytHpnZQGAVAyIa0zM1yimMMT8lP-KwoNUEJM0kDRLye0kawYUrYJ5OKI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOM5uS4JF3nFGN3Z6YdOpgsiAJtuuxM8HLB-P785U5W4g&oe=6AC8EDD2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oCsxc5MdaaUQ7kNvwHhbP22&_nc_oc=Adr9SXrxGKeZTX4MT7_-yVSzgKfciHAA7r82k9F-tortSw3zpMe7XuQ9BWB0uboqdNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNq0wlAKEd8PxQy_fvXk8M8j3OWo7rhUaeJIxxq8WDIRw&oe=6AC8F77D"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a